<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD TEST DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD TEST DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The third and final test</p>
<p>between South Africa and India ended in a draw on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 266-8 declared, South Africa 321 and</p>
<p>228-8.</p>
<p>South Africa win the series 2-0.</p>
</text>
